        <mxCell id="machine_body" parent="machine" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#888888&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;출처: PdM_machines.csv + 합성&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;machineId&lt;/b&gt; (PK)&lt;br&gt;model (model1~4)&lt;br&gt;age (사용 연수)&lt;br&gt;vendorId &lt;font color=&quot;#888888&quot;&gt;모델로 정해짐 (결정 5)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;lastRestartAt, lastRestartBy&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#888888&quot;&gt;재가동 액션만 기록, 처음엔 비어 있음&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;파생 속성&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;status&lt;/b&gt;: 아래 4개 중 하나&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;DOWN (고장 방치) / MAINTENANCE (정비 중)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;READY (재가동 대기) / RUNNING (가동 중)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;hasOpenFailure: 미해결 고장 여부&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;hasUncoveredFailure: 작업지시 없는 고장 여부&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;hasOpenWorkOrder: OPEN 작업지시 여부&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;errorCount7d: 최근 7일 에러 건수&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;lastReplacedAt: 부품별 마지막 교체일&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e7d32&quot;&gt;riskLevel: HIGH (높음) / MEDIUM (중간) / LOW (낮음)&lt;br&gt;riskReasons: riskLevel 판정 근거 목록&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#888888&quot;&gt;100대&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
